[PROCESS_ALTERNATIVE]
UID: PA-01-1
OUTCOME: Resume
TITLE: TBD
STATEMENT: >>>
TBD - A major alternative path: an error the business cares about, an
alternative user choice that changes the flow, or business-level exception
handling.

Keep these high-level. Detailed error handling belongs at L3. The Extends
relation names the step this branches from, which is what makes the anchor
checkable rather than a numbering convention.
